{"format":"xsb-tiku-1","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","questions":[{"id":"his-h1-001","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"中国历史上第一个王朝是哪个？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"宋朝","image":null},{"text":"清朝","image":null},{"text":"唐朝","image":null},{"text":"夏朝","image":null}],"answer":3,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["宋朝"],["清朝"],["唐朝"],["夏朝"]],"explain":"传说大禹的儿子启建立了夏朝，这是中国第一个王朝。"},{"id":"his-h1-002","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"夏朝之后是商朝，商朝之后是哪个朝代？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"明朝","image":null},{"text":"周朝","image":null},{"text":"汉朝","image":null},{"text":"元朝","image":null}],"answer":1,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["明朝"],["周朝"],["汉朝"],["元朝"]],"explain":"顺序是：夏、商、周。"},{"id":"his-h1-003","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"大禹治水主要用的是什么办法？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"挖河道把水引走","image":null},{"text":"用土把水堵住","image":null},{"text":"天天求雨","image":null},{"text":"全家搬走","image":null}],"answer":0,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["挖河道把水引走"],["用土把水堵住"],["天天求雨"],["全家搬走"]],"explain":"大禹的爸爸鲧用堵的办法没成功，大禹改成疏导，挖河道把洪水引到大海里。"},{"id":"his-h1-004","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"大禹治水“三过家门而不入”，说明他是个怎样的人？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"一心为大家做事","image":null},{"text":"迷路了","image":null},{"text":"忘了家在哪","image":null},{"text":"不喜欢回家","image":null}],"answer":0,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["一心为大家做事"],["迷路了"],["忘了家在哪"],["不喜欢回家"]],"explain":"大禹忙着治水，三次路过家门都没进去。"},{"id":"his-h1-005","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"传说中尝百草、教人们种庄稼的是谁？","image":nul