t_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"甲骨文是刻在什么上面的字？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"布上","image":null},{"text":"手机上","image":null},{"text":"纸上","image":null},{"text":"龟甲和兽骨","image":null}],"answer":3,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["布上"],["手机上"],["纸上"],["龟甲和兽骨"]],"explain":"商朝人把字刻在乌龟壳和动物骨头上，叫甲骨文，是中国很早的文字。"},{"id":"his-h1-011","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"在纸发明以前，古人常把字写在什么上？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"竹简","image":null},{"text":"玻璃","image":null},{"text":"塑料","image":null},{"text":"黑板","image":null}],"answer":0,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["竹简"],["玻璃"],["塑料"],["黑板"]],"explain":"把竹子削成一条一条的竹片，在上面写字，再用绳子串起来。"},{"id":"his-h1-012","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"被称为中华民族“母亲河”的是哪条河？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"长江","image":null},{"text":"尼罗河","image":null},{"text":"亚马孙河","image":null},{"text":"黄河","image":null}],"answer":3,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["长江"],["尼罗河"],["亚马孙河"],["黄河"]],"explain":"很早很早以前，我们的祖先就在黄河边生活。"},{"id":"his-h1-013","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"河姆渡的古人很早就会种什么？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"水稻","image":null},{"text":"土豆","image":null},{"text":"玉米","image":null},{"text":"西瓜","image":null}],"answer":0,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["水稻"],["土豆"],["玉米"],["西瓜"]],"explain":"河姆渡遗址在浙江，那里发现了七千年前的稻谷。"},{"id":"his-h1-014","subject":"history","subject_name":"历史","unit_id":"h1","unit":"中国 · 传说和早期","type_id":"quiz","type":"历史知识","question":"北京周口店发现的“北京人”已经会使用什么？","image":null,"answer_type":"choice","options":[{"text":"火","image":null},{"text":"电","image":null},{"text":"手机","image":null},{"text":"汽车","image":null}],"answer":0,"accept":[],"accept_options":[["火"],["电"],["手